<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BRL Hardy year net up to A$23.06 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BRL Hardy year net up to A$23.06 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
